  "description": "Move-in ready and filled with warmth, this fantastic Westminster home offers an abundance of space, beautiful natural light, and the perfect blend of formal and informal living areas. Charming wood beam accents add character, while tasteful updates throughout provide modern comfort and style. Unwind year-round in the inviting sunroom or gather around the cozy fireplace in the family room. The spacious eat-in kitchen is designed for everyday living and entertaining, featuring new stainless steel appliances, granite countertops, warm wood cabinetry with decorative glass-front accents, and generous prep and storage space. Upstairs, you'll find four spacious bedrooms, including a welcoming primary suite with vaulted ceilings, ample closet space, an updated en-suite bath, and pretty mountain views from the bedroom window. The finished basement expands the living space with an additional family room, bathroom, and a second laundry area\u2014ideal for guests, multi-generational living, or added convenience. Step outside to enjoy a peaceful, private backyard shaded by mature trees and lush landscaping. The large patio is perfect for outdoor entertaining, while the fire pit, raised garden beds, and adorable dog house create a backyard everyone\u2014including Fido\u2014will love. Just two blocks to community pool, tennis courts, parks, and walking trails. Recent improvements include a fully updated sprinkler system for both the front and back yards and a new PVC main sewer line installed in 2024, offering added peace of mind. Ideally located with quick access to US-36 and I-25, you'll enjoy an easy commute along with convenient access to abundant shopping, dining, and everyday amenities. This move-in-ready gem truly has it all.",
